---
import Capture from './Capture.astro';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import inspection from '../assets/inspection.png';
import research from '../assets/research.png';
import output from '../assets/output.png';
---
<section id="inside" class="section workflow container" aria-labelledby="inside-title">
  <div class="section-split">
    <SectionHeading index="02" label="Real terminal workflow" title="What it actually feels like." id="inside-title" />
    <p class="section-aside">Real captures from a connected Kaggle session. Code, local tools and model responses, in the terminal you already use.</p>
  </div>
  <article id="scene-inspection" class="workflow-primary" aria-labelledby="inspection-title">
    <div class="scene-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / INSPECT · PROPOSE · APPROVE</p><h3 id="inspection-title">Read the project. Review the next step.</h3></div><p>Local file reads, a proposed test command, and a request for permission before execution.</p></div>
    <Capture image={inspection} label="File inspection & proposed test" alt="Actual FreeCompute CLI: local list and read tool activity, two calculator tests, a proposed Python unittest command, and a model request for permission." caption="The agent inspects calculator files and proposes a test command. Permission is pending in this capture; this is not a test-pass receipt." />
  </article>
  <div class="workflow-secondary">
    <article id="scene-research" class="workflow-research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
      <div class="scene-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / WEB TOOLS</p><h3 id="research-title">Research from the same prompt.</h3></div></div>
      <Capture image={research} sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1320px) 60vw, 720px" label="Web-tool activity" alt="Actual FreeCompute CLI: the search_web tool completes a football-related query before the model returns an answer." caption="A real search_web event followed by model output. The answer is not independently fact-checked or endorsed." />
    </article>
    <article id="scene-output" class="workflow-output" aria-labelledby="output-title">
      <div class="scene-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / ANSWERS IN YOUR TERMINAL</p><h3 id="output-title">Code, then an explanation.</h3></div></div>
      <Capture image={output} variant="output" sizes="1100px" label="Terminal answer" alt="Actual FreeCompute CLI answer with a list of the first ten primes, a code explanation and a saved local session reference." caption="A detail of the model’s answer and explanation, not a program-execution receipt. Enlarge for the complete capture." />
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-notes">
    <div><p class="mono">/sessions · /resume · /diff · /undo</p><h3>Pick up where you left off.</h3><p>The local Core saves conversations and recorded changes. Resume a session or review an approved undo without replaying completed effects.</p></div>
    <div><p class="mono">/model · /workers · /skills</p><h3>Make the route yours.</h3><p>Choose configured model and worker routes. Use bundled, user or project skills. Type <code>/</code> for the live command menu.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
